sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Browser
  participant A as Apache
  participant F as Front Controller
  participant R as Router
  participant C as Controller
  participant M as Model
  participant D as MySQL via PDO
  U->>A: HTTP request
  A->>F: rewrite URL động
  F->>R: dispatch method/path
  R->>C: gọi action
  C->>M: truy vấn nghiệp vụ
  M->>D: prepared SQL / transaction
  D-->>M: rows / kết quả
  M-->>C: dữ liệu
  C-->>U: HTML view hoặc redirect
